@startuml profiles-features
' Application feature modules inside Profiles.
' ArchUnit: PlantUmlArchitectureTest.featureModulesFollowCommittedDiagram
' Only photos → profile is a real DAG. profile ↔ moderation is a cycle
' (usecases call ProfileContentModerator; moderator imports profile/photos
' exceptions). That cycle stays off this diagram.

title Profiles application features
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

[profile] <<com.tinder.profiles.application.profile..>>
[photos] <<com.tinder.profiles.application.photos..>>

photos --> profile

note bottom
  application.moderation sits beside profile.
  Do not ArchUnit it with these two packages.
end note

@enduml
